                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">You completed the routine. Use the button below to reset all counters and start again.</p>

                    <button id="resetBtn" type="button" class="px-6 py-3 bg-red-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-red-700 font-semibold">
                        Reset All Counters
                    </button>
                </div>
